#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:4
msgid "First steps with ROS - learning path"
msgstr "ROS 入門 - 學習路徑"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:6
msgid ""
"ROS (Robot Operating System) is an open-source ecosystem that provides "
"framework, tools, and libraries for building, deploying, running, and "
"maintaining robotic applications. This page presents a set of articles and "
"hands-on activities to introduce the main concepts behind the ROS framework. "
"Working through these will give you the essential knowledge needed to start "
"developing applications with ROS."
msgstr ""
"ROS（機器人作業系統）是一個開源生態系統，提供框架、工具和程式庫，用於建置、部"
"署、執行和維護機器人應用程式。本頁面提供一系列文章與實作活動，介紹 ROS 框架背"
"後的核心概念。完成這些內容後，你將具備開始使用 ROS 開發應用程式所需的基礎知"
"識。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Area: ROS-framework | Content-type: learning-path | Experience: beginner**"
msgstr "**領域：ROS 框架 | 內容類型：學習路徑 | 經驗等級：初學者**"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:14
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目次"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:17
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:19
msgid ""
"The ROS framework is the “plumbing” which makes communication between "
"different parts of a robot possible. It includes messaging, standard "
"interfaces, and support for multiple programming languages and platforms."
msgstr ""
"ROS 框架就像是「管線系統」，讓機器人各個不同部分之間能夠彼此通訊。它包含訊息"
"傳遞、標準介面，以及對多種程式語言和平台的支援。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:22
msgid ""
"You need to understand the fundamental concepts of the framework before you "
"can work with ROS to develop or maintain applications. The turtlesim tool "
"and the tutorials in this site will help you get up to speed."
msgstr ""
"在使用 ROS 開發或維護應用程式之前，你需要先了解框架的基本概念。turtlesim 工具"
"和本站的教學將會幫助你快速上手。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:27
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先備知識"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:29
msgid ""
"None. The steps outlined in this article will guide you through downloading "
"and installing everything you need to learn the basics of ROS."
msgstr "無。本文所列的步驟將引導你下載並安裝學習 ROS 基礎所需的一切。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:33
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步驟"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:36
msgid "1 Learn about fundamental concepts behind ROS"
msgstr "1 了解 ROS 背後的基本概念"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:38
msgid ":doc:`About ROS </About-ROS>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:39
msgid ":doc:`/Concepts/Basic/About-Nodes`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:40
msgid ":doc:`/Concepts/Basic/Interfaces-Topics-Services-Actions`"
msgstr ""

