#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:44
msgid "2 Install ROS and turtlesim"
msgstr "2 安裝 ROS 與 turtlesim"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:46
msgid ""
"ROS installation includes the essential packages for working with ROS. If "
"you're familiar with Linux, our recommended platform is Ubuntu (deb "
"packages). Otherwise, a good alternative installation platform is Windows "
"(binaries): :doc:`Installation options </Installation>`"
msgstr ""
"ROS 安裝包含了使用 ROS 所需的基本套件。如果你熟悉 Linux，我們推薦使用 Ubuntu"
"（deb 套件）。否則，Windows（二進位檔）也是一個不錯的替代安裝平台：:doc:`安裝"
"選項 </Installation>`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:50
msgid ""
"With turtlesim, a lightweight 2D simulation tool designed for beginners, you "
"can learn core ROS concepts in a simple visual environment: :doc:`Install "
"and set up turtlesim </Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Introducing-Turtlesim/"
"Introducing-Turtlesim>`"
msgstr ""
"turtlesim 是一款專為初學者設計的輕量級 2D 模擬工具，你可以在簡單的視覺化環境"
"中學習 ROS 的核心概念：:doc:`安裝與設定 turtlesim </Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-"
"Tools/Introducing-Turtlesim/Introducing-Turtlesim>`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:53
msgid ""
"3 Try out working with the main communication components of the ROS framework"
msgstr "3 嘗試使用 ROS 框架的主要通訊元件"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:55
msgid ""
"Use turtlesim to familiarize yourself with the main communication components "
"and try out messaging in the ROS framework."
msgstr "使用 turtlesim 來熟悉主要的通訊元件，並在 ROS 框架中嘗試訊息傳遞。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:57
msgid ""
"Complete the nodes tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Nodes/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes`"
msgstr ""
"完成節點教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Nodes`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:58
msgid ""
"Complete the topics tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics`"
msgstr ""
"完成主題教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Topics`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:59
msgid ""
"Complete the services tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Services/Understanding-ROS2-Services`"
msgstr ""
"完成服務教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-"
"Services/Understanding-ROS2-Services`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:60
msgid ""
"Complete the parameters tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Parameters/Understanding-ROS2-Parameters`"
msgstr ""
"完成參數教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-"
"Parameters/Understanding-ROS2-Parameters`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:61
msgid ""
"Complete the actions tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions`"
msgstr ""
"完成動作教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Actions/"
"Understanding-ROS2-Actions`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:64
msgid "4 Learn about introspection with logs"
msgstr "4 了解透過日誌進行內省"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:66
msgid ""
"Introspection enables you to see information about how a system is "
"operating. Nodes use logs to output messages concerning events and status in "
"a variety of ways."
msgstr ""
"內省功能讓你能夠查看系統運作的相關資訊。節點使用日誌以多種方式輸出有關事件和"
"狀態的訊息。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:69
msgid ""
"To see introspection through logs in action, complete the rqt_console "
"tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Using-Rqt-Console/Using-Rqt-"
"Console`"
msgstr ""
"若要實際觀察透過日誌進行的內省，請完成 rqt_console 教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/"
"Beginner-CLI-Tools/Using-Rqt-Console/Using-Rqt-Console`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:72
msgid "5 Learn about using launch files"
msgstr "5 了解使用啟動檔"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:74
msgid ""
"Launch files allow you to start and configure a number of processes "
"containing ROS nodes simultaneously, instead of opening multiple terminals "
"and re-entering configuration details for each node."
msgstr ""
"啟動檔讓你能夠同時啟動並設定多個包含 ROS 節點的處理程序，而不需要開啟多個終端"
"機並為每個節點重新輸入設定細節。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:76
msgid ""
"Complete the launch files tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/"
"Launching-Multiple-Nodes/Launching-Multiple-Nodes`"
msgstr ""
"完成啟動檔教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Launching-Multiple-Nodes/"
"Launching-Multiple-Nodes`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:79
msgid "6 Learn about data recording and playback"
msgstr "6 了解資料錄製與回放"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:81
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's useful to replay data to reproduce the results of your tests "
"and experiments, to debug your robot's behaviour, or to share your work with "
"others."
msgstr ""
"有時重播資料會很有用，可以重現測試和實驗的結果、除錯機器人的行為，或與他人分"
"享你的工作成果。"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:83
msgid ""
"Complete the recording and playback tutorial: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-"
"Tools/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data`"
msgstr ""
"完成錄製與回放教學：:doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Recording-And-"
"Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data`"

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:86
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

