msgid ""
"To complete your knowledge of the ROS framework, we recommend familiarizing "
"yourself with ROS client libraries: :doc:`/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-"
"Libraries`"
msgstr ""
"為了完善你對 ROS 框架的了解，我們建議你熟悉 ROS 客戶端程式庫：:doc:`/"
"Tutorials/Beginner-Client-Libraries`"
